    "key": "chatChips.agentsWindow",
    "type": "boolean",
    "default": true,
    "description": "Also show the usage chips beneath the chat input in the **Agents** (sessions) window. The Agents window only runs extensions installed locally and listed in `#extensions.supportAgentsWindow#` (local user settings). The extension there runs on your local computer and shows the logins found **there**, also for remote sessions; a chat whose agent is not signed in locally gets an `n/a` chip. [Enable AI Usage there](command:aiUsage.enableAgentsWindow) · [Open user settings.json](command:workbench.action.openSettingsJson) · [Setup guide](command:aiUsage.openAgentsWindowSetup) · [README](https://github.com/p0l0us/ai-usage-vscode-plugin#agents-sessions-window)."
