  },
  {
    "key": "chatTokens.enabled",
    "type": "boolean",
    "default": true,
277:    "description": "Maximum number of workflow agents Claude Code runs at the same time (at most 256); Claude Code defaults to 16, or fewer on machines with few CPUs. Written as `env.CLAUDE_CODE_WORKFLOW_MAX_CONCURRENT_AGENTS` in Claude Code user settings. Needs Claude Code 2.1.269 or later. Leave empty (`null`) to keep whatever `settings.json` already says; clearing the setting later does not remove the value from the file."

